    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a bonus action, you can expend a use of your Devotion to fuel your spells. You regain one expended spell slot, the level of which can be no higher than half your proficiency bonus (rounded up).</p><p>The number of times you can use this feature is based on the level you've reached in this class: 2nd level, once; 6th level, twice; and 18th level, thrice. You regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>",
